		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=521#p521"><![CDATA[
So if I am trying to do TOI for a baraff implementation of collisions (in the special case of 2D physics only) what do you people recommend? The problem is that most papers out there are targeted for 3D, so what do you guys think is a strong way of doing it in the special case of 2D.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=191">fork</a> — Sat Dec 17, 2005 11:37 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
